# Jaded Analyst: "Defender. Whenever you draw your second card each turn, this creature loses defender and gains vigilance until end of turn" (CR 702.3, 702.20,
# 121.1, 611.2a). Cast on turn 1 off Mox Sapphire and Mox Pearl beside a Memnite. On turn 3 the draw step's card is only Bot1's first: it still has defender. Ancestral
# Recall's first card is the second: it loses defender and gains vigilance, attacks for 3 and stays untapped. On turn 5 the effect is over: defender again, so it may not
# attack beside the Memnite that does.

